2026-09-04 18:40:59 [INFO   ] main: AMRSystem itself (core/amr_cycle.py) has NO internal frequency ceiling: frequency only ever enters W_eddy~f^2 and W_hys~f (both monotonic, uncapped parasitic-loss terms), never a hard cutoff on cooling_capacity() or magnetic_work().
